# --- Workspace (polyrepo spine host) additions -------------------------------
# Merge these lines into the core .gitignore; never replace it.

# Member checkouts. Each member repo is its OWN work tree cloned inside this one
# (`mise run ws:clone` puts it at the `path:` from spec/workspace.yml) — not a
# submodule, so nothing pins a SHA and no member commit ever dirties this repo.
# Ignoring the dirs is what keeps a member's code out of the workspace's history.
#
# One line per member; /steer:init resolves them from the manifest and
# `mise run ws:status` reports any member that is missing here. Anchored with a
# leading slash so a member named `docs` doesn't also ignore `apps/docs`.
# /frontend/
# /backend/

# Generated VS Code multi-root workspace (`mise run ws:code` — derived from
# spec/workspace.yml, which is the source of truth).
*.code-workspace
